Lemma "user/Lyapunov Stability Single Machine (parametric in D)".
"  ==>  \forall D (((D) > ((0)))->(\forall eps (((eps) > ((0)))->(\exists delta (((delta) > ((0)))&(\forall d (\forall w (((((d)^((2)))+((w)^((2)))) < (delta))->([{d'=w,w'=(-(d))-((D)*(w))}]((((d)^((2)))+((w)^((2)))) < (eps)))))))))))
\qed::23e3b20ae0b9126b14c8e7d2f6809d11"
